IR-gen mis-types a float32 expression that mixes multiply-by-untyped-const with a bare float32 addend: the const promotes to float64 and the mixed double+float32 add is resolved to an INTEGER add (fptosi + add i64), so native emits garbage and LLVM emits malformed IR clang rejects. Pre-existing IR-gen type-resolution defect; see claude-todo.md (CRITICAL).
